id=vpnhide_zygisk
name=VPNHide Next (Zygisk native)
version=v1.1.0
versionCode=10100
author=soranerai
description=Hides active VPN interfaces from selected apps by inline-hooking libc ioctl via shadowhook. Covers the native detection path (Flutter, JNI, raw C/C++) that Java-level LSPosed modules can't reach. Manage targets via VPNHide Next app.
